          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP232 Lunnford&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This cap requires a short walk down the edge of a farmers field and a short hunt in the long grass...made for a pretty quick grab today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth&lt;/p&gt;

